 "204": {
  "action": "confirm",
  "canonical": "Prefer anonymous or semi-anonymous immediate response over a show of hands \u2014 students do not want to answer against the person next to them \u2014 and use interspersed response questions or devices that record answers instantly, so even a large lecture can see the distribution in real time and be reprogrammed on the spot."
 },
