 "208": {
  "action": "confirm",
  "canonical": "Plan instruction deliberately at nested levels \u2014 lesson inside topic inside course or curriculum \u2014 rather than leaving it to moment-to-moment improvisation: the purpose of planning is predictable results and intelligent improvisation rests on a good blueprint, so reject the belief that good teaching comes through artful spontaneity."
 },
