 "868": {
  "action": "confirm",
  "canonical": "Compress rare or slowly occurring real-world experience into simulated job-realistic scenarios and deliberately ordered cases, because the workplace delivers such problems too rarely and in no order of complexity \u2014 in one reported comparison, twenty to twenty-five hours in a coached troubleshooting environment matched four years on the job."
 },
